VISUAL: A detailed view of the Jellyfin interface, showing various movies and TV shows.
AUDIO: 'completely for free with a great interface, super interactive, just like Netflix. It pulls Rotten Tomato ratings, it pulls the full IMDb page so you can see the actors/actresses that are in the content you\'re watching. This isn\'t just'

